WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.050
- [Kelly] I love how open you are.

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:04.120
You actually got a COVID
vaccine live on "Today,"

00:00:04.120 --> 00:00:07.040
so some think it's controversial.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:10.130
So why was it important
to you to do on air?

00:00:10.130 --> 00:00:12.560
- Look, I think that I'm,

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.520
sadly, I'm the only
one on the "Today" show

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:16.770
old enough to get the shot.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:17.993
I'm over 65.

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:21.650
And by the way, that ties
into the other issue.

00:00:21.650 --> 00:00:22.880
You know, a lot of us,

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:25.140
a lot of people have been putting
off getting health checks,

00:00:25.140 --> 00:00:28.730
normal health checks
because of the pandemic,

00:00:28.730 --> 00:00:29.890
either because they've had to,

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:31.590
or, you know, it's just been difficult.

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:34.680
So, and I think there's
been some reluctance

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:36.000
for people to get it.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.340
And especially, again,
not to harp on this,

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:43.240
but, you know, people of
color and Latinx folks

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:45.280
have had issues, you know,

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:49.790
there in those communities,
getting the vaccine.

00:00:49.790 --> 00:00:52.560
So I just wanted to go in there

00:00:52.560 --> 00:00:56.220
and try to show people,
hey, look, this is easy.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:00:57.053
If you can get it.

00:00:57.053 --> 00:00:59.750
Now, look, there are a
lot of issues with supply,

00:00:59.750 --> 00:01:02.420
but it's, you know, I
think it's important.

00:01:02.420 --> 00:01:05.810
The only way we're gonna lick this thing

00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.190
is for us to all take responsibility

00:01:08.190 --> 00:01:10.260
for ourselves and for other people.

00:01:10.260 --> 00:01:11.960
So that means wearing a mask.

00:01:11.960 --> 00:01:14.490
That means getting,
doing social distancing,

00:01:14.490 --> 00:01:18.420
washing hands, and getting
your COVID vaccine.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:20.610
- And so we can get our lives back.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:21.443
How 'bout that?

00:01:21.443 --> 00:01:22.387
Yeah. (laughs)
- That's right.

00:01:22.387 --> 00:01:26.110
- And in fact, our parent
company, Comcast NBCUniversal,

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:28.880
is trying to help folks plan your vaccine

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:31.780
so that we all get together
and can see our loved ones.

00:01:31.780 --> 00:01:35.820
So all you have to do is
go to planyourvaccine.com,

00:01:35.820 --> 00:01:37.190
sign up for an interactive site,

00:01:37.190 --> 00:01:39.050
gives you all the vaccine information

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:40.380
you'll need in one place

00:01:40.380 --> 00:01:42.180
so that when you get your appointment,

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:44.070
you are ready to go!

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:44.903
- [Kelly] Right on.

00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:46.734
You should've been a coach!

00:01:46.734 --> 00:01:47.634
You're good at it!

